      "schema:name": "lo-shows-reversed-specificity",
      "schema:description": "In lateral occipital cortex (LO), the information-content pattern reverses relative to foveal V1: cross-shape decoding drops significantly (experimental: t(27)=3.41, p=0.002, difference=5.31%; control: t(27)=7.25, p<0.001, difference=6.7%) while cross-category decoding remains high, indicating that LO captures semantic category rather than low-level shape.",
      "mira:epistemicStatus": "mira:Claim",
