      "@type": "mira:Evidence",
      "schema:name": "v1-category-decoding-drops-in-feedback",
      "schema:description": "In foveal V1, decoding across semantic category drops significantly relative to baseline in the experimental condition (t(27)=2.25, p=0.033, difference=3.03%), while decoding across visual shape remains high, indicating that foveal feedback carries shape but not category information.",
